            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_2",
            "review_title": "Review at Uchi Sushi",
            "review_text": "Anna\nCuenca, Ecuador29 contributions\n1\nBad service\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nThey offer a buffet on their website. We called and they said sashimi was included, so we went there. It's not. \n\nThey have literally no clue what they offer. They had to go back and forth and discuss things with each other and they literally kept changing the deal in the 20 minutes we waited there for them to figure thing out. \n\nThe price went up while we there from 40.000 to about 550000, even though it stated another price on the menu. They tried to charge extra for all the other options of the menu. \n\nThis is not a buffet option. You only have the option to pick 3 dishes max and you can only rotate between those. For the rest you have to pay extra. \n\nWhole staff combined speaks 3 words of English. Completely useless if you don't speak Vietnamese.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nWritten February 26, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-12",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
